      "en": "even when we were dead through our trespasses, made us alive together with Christ—by grace you have been saved—",
      "ko": "허물로 죽은 우리를 그리스도와 함께 살리셨고 (너희가 은혜로 구원을 얻은 것이라)",
      "source_text_hash": "bca056674839eae08539a210b16e6cc18df87ab292173e904cd8bdc2fd297e06",
      "translation_text_hash": "2c56e072dd5105e65be3f869deac3f6000d566979930eeb8a9974580c99248b6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
