      "en": "and raised us up with him, and made us to sit with him in the heavenly places in Christ Jesus,",
      "ko": "또 함께 일으키사 그리스도 예수 안에서 함께 하늘에 앉히시니",
      "source_text_hash": "1bdb309c244f821a4994fef604aee9f3dbd97fb41f019e60d143dd71e26f48fa",
      "translation_text_hash": "97fb682c52eb28284228c895834a8472e8f411979007fb24ae109fad67637248",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "또 함께 일으키사 그리스도 예수 안에서 함께 하늘에 앉히시니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "97fb682c52eb28284228c895834a8472e8f411979007fb24ae109fad67637248"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:EPH:2:7",
      "sequence": 29233,
      "chapter_label": "EPH 2",
      "verse_label": "7",
